Differences from upstream (this build)
--------------------------------------

  * Branding: the user-visible product name is "Mozi AoE" and the website is
    https://u8erp.com . The command (`aoe`), config directory, and tmux
    session prefix are unchanged from upstream so existing setups keep working.
  * Update checks point at this fork's GitHub releases, not upstream.
  * Telemetry to the upstream collection gateway is disabled; the opt-in
    toggle in Settings is a no-op.
  * The default Docker sandbox image and bundled notification sounds still
    reference upstream's public assets.

